{
    "title": "Applaydu Play & Discover",
    "description": "<h1>Celebrate Halloween with Applaydu!</h1>\r\nThe trick-or-treating fun on spooky Halloween Island is ready to be explored! Let your kids craft potions, cast spooky spells on their favorite characters & unleash their creativity with Halloween-themed drawings. Kids can turn a home into a real haunted house with Halloween decorations. Parents & kids can enjoy the newly-added Halloween experiences, making this a memorable holiday experience for your family!\r\n\r\n<h1>Unlock a New World of Learning in Applaydu Season 5</h1>\r\nApplaydu by Kinder is a safe learning world for kids, filled with various themed islands to develop skills through playing. Applaydu Season 5 is back with even more fun. Your kids can learn about math & letters and unleash their imagination by creating stories on the new LET'S STORY! Island. They can also learn to heal injured animals with veterinary games & care for the planet while exploring in NATOONS.\r\nWatch kids create their own stories, diving into diverse learning themes and engaging in innovative AR experiences. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, ad-free and ensures high-quality screen time under parental supervision.\r\n\r\n<h1>Kids Create Their Own Adventures on LET'S STORY! Island</h1>\r\nApplaydu by Kinder is welcoming LET'S STORY!, a new island where kids can create their own tales and engage in captivating stories. Children can choose characters, destinations and plots & create a rich story experience from images to audio. Parents & kids can listen to stories together and enjoy mini-games to inspire young minds.\r\n\r\n<h1>Discover Wild Animals in NATOONS & Learn How to Care for Them</h1>\r\nLet's welcome the baby animals to the NATOONS world! Children can discover wild animals & learn how baby animals are born, how they sound and what their habitats are. Your kids can foster a connection with nature through activities such as saving animals & picking up trash.\r\nKids can step into the role of future vets, learning to heal animals. Let your children immerse themselves in the educational world of Applaydu NATOONS, where endless stories, learning adventures and games await!\r\n\r\n<h1>Unleash Creativity with the Avatar House</h1>\r\nKids can create haunted houses with spooky Halloween avatar customization. They can express their unique style by decorating a custom bedroom with pumpkins & bats, drawing their Halloween floors and wallpaper. Tons of possible creations await in the Avatar House.\r\n\r\n<h1>Multiple Learning Games to Grow Skills</h1>\r\nStep into Applaydu by Kinder with inspiring educational games and stories. Various game types, from logic puzzles and coding to racing, history, augmented reality activities and animal petting, offer an immersive learning experience. Your kids can be creative by drawing and coloring Halloween themes, playing with dinosaurs or engaging in educational games with math, numbers, letters and history.\r\n\r\n<h1>Teleport to the AR World in Applaydu by Kinder </h1>\r\nKeep your children active at home with the AR movement games based on JOY OF MOVING, an educational method that encourages children to be active through playing. Help your kids use the 3D scan to teleport their favorite characters to the Applaydu AR world so they can play and even talk to them. \r\n\r\n<h1>Monitor your Child's Learning Progress</h1>\r\nEnsuring a safe and educational environment for your kids is effortless with Applaydu's parent area, which allows you to monitor your child's progress with personalized recommendations. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, playable offline, ad-free, has no in-app purchases and supports over 18 languages.\r\n______\r\nApplaydu, an Official Kinder App, is certified by the kidSAFE Seal Program (www.kidsafeseal.com) and EducationalAppStore.com.\r\nContact us at contact@applaydu.com\r\nFor privacy-related questions, please write to privacy@ferrero.com or go to http://applaydu.kinder.com/legal\r\nTo find instructions to delete your account, please visit:\r\nhttps://applaydu.kinder.com/static/public/docs/web/en/pp/pp-0.0.1.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Celebrate Halloween with Applaydu!</h1><br>The trick-or-treating fun on spooky Halloween Island is ready to be explored! Let your kids craft potions, cast spooky spells on their favorite characters &amp; unleash their creativity with Halloween-themed drawings. Kids can turn a home into a real haunted house with Halloween decorations. Parents &amp; kids can enjoy the newly-added Halloween experiences, making this a memorable holiday experience for your family!<br><br><h1>Unlock a New World of Learning in Applaydu Season 5</h1><br>Applaydu by Kinder is a safe learning world for kids, filled with various themed islands to develop skills through playing. Applaydu Season 5 is back with even more fun. Your kids can learn about math &amp; letters and unleash their imagination by creating stories on the new LET&#39;S STORY! Island. They can also learn to heal injured animals with veterinary games &amp; care for the planet while exploring in NATOONS.<br>Watch kids create their own stories, diving into diverse learning themes and engaging in innovative AR experiences. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, ad-free and ensures high-quality screen time under parental supervision.<br><br><h1>Kids Create Their Own Adventures on LET&#39;S STORY! Island</h1><br>Applaydu by Kinder is welcoming LET&#39;S STORY!, a new island where kids can create their own tales and engage in captivating stories. Children can choose characters, destinations and plots &amp; create a rich story experience from images to audio. Parents &amp; kids can listen to stories together and enjoy mini-games to inspire young minds.<br><br><h1>Discover Wild Animals in NATOONS &amp; Learn How to Care for Them</h1><br>Let&#39;s welcome the baby animals to the NATOONS world! Children can discover wild animals &amp; learn how baby animals are born, how they sound and what their habitats are. Your kids can foster a connection with nature through activities such as saving animals &amp; picking up trash.<br>Kids can step into the role of future vets, learning to heal animals. Let your children immerse themselves in the educational world of Applaydu NATOONS, where endless stories, learning adventures and games await!<br><br><h1>Unleash Creativity with the Avatar House</h1><br>Kids can create haunted houses with spooky Halloween avatar customization. They can express their unique style by decorating a custom bedroom with pumpkins &amp; bats, drawing their Halloween floors and wallpaper. Tons of possible creations await in the Avatar House.<br><br><h1>Multiple Learning Games to Grow Skills</h1><br>Step into Applaydu by Kinder with inspiring educational games and stories. Various game types, from logic puzzles and coding to racing, history, augmented reality activities and animal petting, offer an immersive learning experience. Your kids can be creative by drawing and coloring Halloween themes, playing with dinosaurs or engaging in educational games with math, numbers, letters and history.<br><br><h1>Teleport to the AR World in Applaydu by Kinder </h1><br>Keep your children active at home with the AR movement games based on JOY OF MOVING, an educational method that encourages children to be active through playing. Help your kids use the 3D scan to teleport their favorite characters to the Applaydu AR world so they can play and even talk to them. <br><br><h1>Monitor your Child&#39;s Learning Progress</h1><br>Ensuring a safe and educational environment for your kids is effortless with Applaydu&#39;s parent area, which allows you to monitor your child&#39;s progress with personalized recommendations. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, playable offline, ad-free, has no in-app purchases and supports over 18 languages.<br>______<br>Applaydu, an Official Kinder App, is certified by the kidSAFE Seal Program (www.kidsafeseal.com) and EducationalAppStore.com.<br>Contact us at contact@applaydu.com<br>For privacy-related questions, please write to privacy@ferrero.com or go to http://applaydu.kinder.com/legal<br>To find instructions to delete your account, please visit:<br>https://applaydu.kinder.com/static/public/docs/web/en/pp/pp-0.0.1.html",
